# qa_rules.src - what a questioned word means when the story never says it.
# Words are looked up in the lexicon and become concept ids; reasoning uses ids.
#
# event | the answer must | evidence: any of these, about the answer
# owner=subject: the answer belongs to the question's subject
lose|owner=subject|gone take
#
# kind | what makes something one
# A thief is whoever takes someone else's thing.
kind:thief|take
